{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"agent_message","text":"Selected responsibility: **`URLConnection` API surface delegation** currently implemented directly inside `CloseableURLConnection`.\n\nRefactoring applied:\n- Extracted collaborator class: [DelegatingURLConnection.java](/data/henrique/langchain_prototype/codex/data/repositories/commons-io/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/io/DelegatingURLConnection.java)\n- Simplified target class: [CloseableURLConnection.java](/data/henrique/langchain_prototype/codex/data/repositories/commons-io/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/io/CloseableURLConnection.java)\n\nWhat was moved/extracted:\n- Moved the large cohesive group of delegation methods (`connect`, header/query methods, property methods, timeout methods, content methods, `equals/hashCode/toString`, etc.) from `CloseableURLConnection` into `DelegatingURLConnection`.\n- Kept `CloseableURLConnection` focused on:\n1. factory open methods,\n2. lifecycle (`close()`),\n3. minimal operations used by call sites (`getInputStream`, `setConnectTimeout`, `setReadTimeout`),\n4. exposing the wrapped `URLConnection` via `getURLConnection()` for compatibility where `URLConnection` is required.\n\nHow target class was simplified:\n- `CloseableURLConnection` no longer extends `URLConnection`; it now composes `DelegatingURLConnection`.\n- Method count in target class was reduced substantially (well below the thresholds), addressing the Insufficient Modularization smell by removing a broad secondary responsibility.\n\nCall-site updates required:\n- [IOUtils.java](/data/henrique/langchain_prototype/codex/data/repositories/commons-io/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/io/IOUtils.java:3071): `toByteArray(urlConnection)` -> `toByteArray(urlConnection.getURLConnection())`\n- [IOUtilsTest.java](/data/henrique/langchain_prototype/codex/data/repositories/commons-io/src/test/java/org/apache/commons/io/IOUtilsTest.java:1907): same update in `testToByteArray_URLConnection`.\n\nFiles changed:\n1. [CloseableURLConnection.java](/data/henrique/langchain_prototype/codex/data/repositories/commons-io/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/io/CloseableURLConnection.java)\n2. [DelegatingURLConnection.java](/data/henrique/langchain_prototype/codex/data/repositories/commons-io/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/io/DelegatingURLConnection.java)\n3. [IOUtils.java](/data/henrique/langchain_prototype/codex/data/repositories/commons-io/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/io/IOUtils.java)\n4. [IOUtilsTest.java](/data/henrique/langchain_prototype/codex/data/repositories/commons-io/src/test/java/org/apache/commons/io/IOUtilsTest.java)\n\nValidation command execution:\n- Attempted:\n`mvn -q -Djapicmp.skip=true -Drat.skip=true -Dcheckstyle.skip=true -Dspotbugs.skip=true -Dpmd.skip=true -DskipITs clean verify`\n- Environment issue: read-only `~/.m2`, then retried with `-Dmaven.repo.local=/tmp/m2`.\n- Second run failed due network/DNS restriction resolving Maven Central parent POM (`org.apache.commons:commons-parent:pom:100`), so full build/test verification could not complete in this sandbox.\n\nExpected impact on smell:\n- High likelihood of passing IM thresholds for target class (`public methods < 20`, `total methods < 30`) since the delegation bulk was extracted into a focused collaborator.\n\nRemaining risks:\n- `CloseableURLConnection` is no longer a `URLConnection` subtype; internal call sites were updated, but any untracked package-internal usage depending on subtype polymorphism would need the same `getURLConnection()` adaptation."}}
